      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TUTA MOMENT (7) drifted back settling but did best work late to finish 4th at this track over 350m (19.42). Should be very hard to beat this time. BONEY MALONEY (4) goes very well here starting 11 times for five wins and three minors. Comes off a (16.77) win last time, scoring by one length in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. Can feature with the right run. ZABDON BLONDIE (6) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Grade 6 winner three back (16.79) at this track over 300m. Expecting significant improvement. HARDLY EASY (1) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
